  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 17 - 2 + 39 ÷ 3 × 7 = 40\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) ÷ and − \n\n17 - 2 + 39 ÷ 3 × 7 = 40 ⇒ 17 ÷ 2 + 39 - 3 × 7 = 40\n\n⇒ __**17 ÷**____** 2**__ + 39 - 3 × 7 = 40\n\n⇒ 8.5 + 39 - __**3 × 7**__ = 40\n\n⇒ __**8.5**____** + 39**__ - 21 = 40\n\n⇒ __**47.5**____** - 21**__ = 40\n\n⇒ 26.5 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) + and ×\n\n17 - 2 + 39 ÷ 3 × 7 = 40 ⇒ 17 - 2 × 39 ÷ 3 + 7 = 40\n\n⇒ 17 - 2 × __**39 ÷ 3**__ + 7 = 40\n\n⇒ 17 - __**2 **____**×**____** 13**__ + 7 = 40\n\n⇒ __**17 + 7**__ - 26 = 40\n\n⇒ __24** - 26**__ = 40\n\n⇒ -2 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) − and +\n\n17 - 2 + 39 ÷ 3 × 7 = 40 ⇒ 17 + 2 - 39 ÷ 3 × 7 = 40\n\n⇒ 17 + 2 - __**39 ÷ 3**__ × 7 = 40\n\n⇒ 17 + 2 - __**13 × 7**__ = 40\n\n⇒ __**17 + 2**__ - 91 = 40\n\n⇒ __**19 - 91**__ = 40\n\n⇒ -72 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) − and ×\n\n17 - 2 + 39 ÷ 3 × 7 = 40 ⇒ 17 × 2 + 39 ÷ 3 - 7 = 40\n\n⇒ 17 × 2 + __**39 ÷ 3**__ - 7 = 40\n\n⇒ __**17 ×**____** 2**__ + 13 - 7 = 40\n\n⇒ __**34**____** + 13**__ - 7 = 40\n\n⇒ **__47__**__** -**____** 7**__ = 40\n\n**⇒ 40 = 40 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
